  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "\"react_hooks_explanation\"",
  "title": "Content Automation",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Content Automation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "![image.png](Content%20Automation/image.png)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **DSL Enhancements**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- We could extend our YAML-based DSL to include scene types demonstrated in your examples (layouts, signals, interface scenes)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For example, adding scene types like `code_explanation`, `interface_demo`, and `signal_visualization`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Scene Templates Library**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Create a reusable template system based on the example scenes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Code explanation templates (based on signalsCode.tsx)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Layout demonstration templates (from layouts.tsx)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Signal visualization templates (from signals.tsx)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- These become our \"pre-made scene factories\" in the workflow diagram."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Dynamic Code Visualization**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Parse real code snippets in the DSL and automatically generate animated visualizations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- For instance, automatically animate signal flows or component layouts based on actual code."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Audio Integration**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The project.ts shows audio integration. We could extend our DSL to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Narration timestamp markers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Audio synchronization points"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Text-to-speech generation instructions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Scene Composition System**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Create a composition engine that can intelligently sequence scenes from your examples."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Transitions between code explanations, visualizations, and interface demonstrations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here's a potential structure for a DSL entry that leverages these examples:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```yaml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "scene:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "id: \"react_hooks_explanation\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: \"code_tutorial\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "duration: 60"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sections:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- title: \"Understanding useState\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "template: \"code_explanation\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "code_snippet: |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "function Counter() {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const [count, setCount] = useState(0);"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "return ("
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "<button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Count: {count}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "</button>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ");"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "visualization:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: \"signal_flow\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "highlight:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- line: 2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "duration: 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "narration: \"The useState hook creates a state variable and a setter function.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "transition:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type: \"smooth_fade\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "duration: 1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}